{
  "_about": "The curated list of what can be installed on CosmOS. Only these Flatpaks and packages are visible in the Shop, allowed through Kronos and the command-line wrappers, and let through the Flathub remote filter. An entry has a name, a category, and a `flatpak` id and/or `rpm` package names (exact; anything else is refused). `pack` ties an entry to an Expansion Pack (every pack member must be here). `why` is a note for whoever edits this file. Which packaging of an app is used is decided by app-policy.json; anything in `blocked` there stays blocked. To add an app: add an entry, run `cosmos_catalog.py verify`, rebuild.",
